WEBVTT

00:00:23.260 --> 00:00:26.420
So the ETM12 has begun...

00:00:31.380 --> 00:00:33.470
<b>Knight</b>

00:00:46.770 --> 00:00:48.730
<b>Leave breakfast to me! Meow!</b>

00:00:49.370 --> 00:00:50.600
Wow...

00:00:51.520 --> 00:00:53.190
The meat cooking smells great.

00:00:53.910 --> 00:00:55.800
This is kinda nice.

00:01:16.180 --> 00:01:20.720
<b>ETOTAMA</b>

00:02:40.550 --> 00:02:43.890
<b>Episode 2: A Strange and Loving Ox Relationship</b>

00:02:45.610 --> 00:02:47.460
Morning, Takeru!

00:02:47.460 --> 00:02:48.720
M-Morning.

00:02:48.720 --> 00:02:50.750
Breakfast will be ready soon!

00:02:50.750 --> 00:02:51.440
Yep, yep!

00:02:51.700 --> 00:02:52.770
O-Okay.

00:02:52.770 --> 00:02:53.860
Oh, yes!

00:02:53.860 --> 00:02:56.150
Ow! Hot! Hot!

00:02:56.150 --> 00:02:58.020
What are those dying screams?

00:02:58.790 --> 00:03:00.410
I guess the heat's too low!

00:03:00.410 --> 00:03:02.610
Chinese food is all about 
the strength of the flame!

00:03:02.610 --> 00:03:04.070
Chinese food for breakfast?!

00:03:05.080 --> 00:03:06.830
Puff Puff

00:03:05.330 --> 00:03:06.830
That's not Chinese food!

00:03:07.430 --> 00:03:10.540
A feast like this right in front of you, 
and that's your initial reaction?

00:03:10.540 --> 00:03:11.950
Only you, Takeru.

00:03:11.950 --> 00:03:14.590
Wait, put out the fire! Water! Water!

00:03:14.590 --> 00:03:15.710
Here you go.

00:03:16.270 --> 00:03:18.710
Whoa, that smells really good!

00:03:18.940 --> 00:03:20.450
It's sesame oil.

00:03:20.450 --> 00:03:22.050
Why'd you give me that?!

00:03:22.050 --> 00:03:24.170
We have to put out the fire!

00:03:24.170 --> 00:03:26.140
Fire!

00:03:32.530 --> 00:03:34.140
I might as well ask...

00:03:34.140 --> 00:03:36.990
You know all these people, right?

00:03:36.990 --> 00:03:37.570
Yep, yep.

00:03:37.900 --> 00:03:39.750
That smells awesome!

00:03:39.750 --> 00:03:41.530
Smells like a yakiniku place, huh?

00:03:41.530 --> 00:03:43.110
That flame was really goin' strong.

00:03:43.110 --> 00:03:45.700
I just love the aroma of sesame oil.

00:03:45.700 --> 00:03:47.580
Sesame oil and salt are the best.

00:03:47.580 --> 00:03:50.160
Salt and sesame oil go together perfectly.

00:03:50.520 --> 00:03:52.670
Why are you plugging sesame oil so much?

00:03:53.810 --> 00:03:55.760
I'm hungry!

00:03:55.760 --> 00:03:56.920
Yeah!

00:03:56.920 --> 00:03:58.460
Okay, okay. I get it.

00:03:58.500 --> 00:03:59.800
<b>Kitchen</b>

00:04:00.150 --> 00:04:01.970
Now, we'll finish it with some...

00:04:03.090 --> 00:04:05.180
Sesame oil!

00:04:08.510 --> 00:04:10.810
A dash of salt on top of that is the best!

00:04:11.290 --> 00:04:12.750
Give it a try.

00:04:13.940 --> 00:04:16.440
<b>Sesame Oil</b>

00:04:13.940 --> 00:04:16.440
Let's eat!

00:04:21.250 --> 00:04:22.700
What's the matter, Takeru?

00:04:23.000 --> 00:04:25.060
Oh, I thought if you were the Eto-shin,

00:04:25.060 --> 00:04:28.110
there should be twelve of you...

00:04:28.110 --> 00:04:31.160
How come you're acting like 
you've never seen us before?

00:04:31.160 --> 00:04:31.500
Huh?

00:04:31.500 --> 00:04:34.830
What? You and me have already met!

00:04:35.270 --> 00:04:37.630
You don't remember us?

00:04:38.340 --> 00:04:41.590
You know, on the street in Akihabara...

00:04:40.420 --> 00:04:41.590
<b>Losers</b>

00:04:40.420 --> 00:04:41.590
<b>Snake: Winner</b>

00:04:42.420 --> 00:04:43.590
<b>Winners</b>

00:04:43.720 --> 00:04:46.470
He has absolutely no recollection.

00:04:46.700 --> 00:04:48.960
Okay, then list the Chinese 
zodiac in order!

00:04:48.960 --> 00:04:49.720
In order!

00:04:50.020 --> 00:04:51.970
Rat, ox, tiger,

00:04:51.970 --> 00:04:54.450
rabbit, dragon, snake...

00:04:54.450 --> 00:04:55.740
Snake... Oh...

00:04:55.740 --> 00:04:57.310
He remembers now!

00:04:57.610 --> 00:05:00.110
And he stopped at the same place.

00:05:00.110 --> 00:05:04.070
I'm sorry! I'm sorry! 
It's because my name sounds bad!

00:05:04.070 --> 00:05:06.390
This is some kind of trauma 
for her, isn't it?

00:05:06.390 --> 00:05:07.540
Well, she's a horse (uma).

00:05:08.010 --> 00:05:10.890
Uri-tan, you're on the team I 
couldn't remember. You don't mind?

00:05:10.890 --> 00:05:12.040
Should I mind?

00:05:12.040 --> 00:05:13.370
He ignored it...

00:05:13.370 --> 00:05:16.690
I see. You're the one who comes 
up with the clever (umai) lines.

00:05:16.690 --> 00:05:17.880
Well, she's a horse!

00:05:18.180 --> 00:05:20.350
Why do you keep pushing the horse thing?

00:05:20.350 --> 00:05:22.380
Just admit defeat.

00:05:23.800 --> 00:05:24.670
So, by the way...

00:05:25.250 --> 00:05:28.180
Why won't that Eto-shin come over here?

00:05:29.170 --> 00:05:30.840
Piyo-tan has the brain of a bird.

00:05:30.840 --> 00:05:33.130
She loses her memories after 
walking three steps.

00:05:33.130 --> 00:05:35.300
When there's something she 
doesn't want to forget,

00:05:35.300 --> 00:05:37.810
she tries not to move.

00:05:37.810 --> 00:05:38.560
Um...

00:05:39.000 --> 00:05:41.110
What doesn't she want to forget?

00:05:41.110 --> 00:05:43.570
Of course!

00:05:43.570 --> 00:05:47.450
It's her revenge on Nya-tan for 
what she did to us earlier!

00:05:49.060 --> 00:05:51.630
I'll never forgive that stupid cat!

00:05:51.630 --> 00:05:53.330
That's a pretty nasty personality...

00:05:53.330 --> 00:05:54.360
Well, she's a bird!

00:05:56.610 --> 00:05:59.840
Chicken bones (torigara) and personality 
(gara)! She got us good (ippon torareta)!

00:05:59.840 --> 00:06:03.210
Uh, aren't you gonna point out 
that I'm a tiger (tora)?

00:06:03.660 --> 00:06:06.300
M-My ribs are broken...

00:06:06.300 --> 00:06:07.220
Just from that?!

00:06:09.530 --> 00:06:11.600
I'm stuffed.

00:06:11.970 --> 00:06:14.310
Piyo-tan, you're still over there?

00:06:14.310 --> 00:06:15.910
Come in here already.

00:06:15.910 --> 00:06:18.270
Shut up! You think I want to eat with you?!

00:06:18.500 --> 00:06:21.770
Don't say that. 
There's enough for you, too.

00:06:22.070 --> 00:06:23.550
Shut up, stupid cat!

00:06:23.550 --> 00:06:24.780
Stupid, stupid!

00:06:25.840 --> 00:06:26.530
Hey!

00:06:26.530 --> 00:06:29.860
You shouldn't... throw... food...

00:06:27.950 --> 00:06:28.450
<b>Steps</b>

00:06:28.570 --> 00:06:29.070
<b>Steps</b>

00:06:29.280 --> 00:06:29.860
<b>Steps</b>

00:06:31.870 --> 00:06:32.240
<b>Chomp</b>

00:06:34.210 --> 00:06:35.870
And she forgot.

00:06:36.880 --> 00:06:38.850
That was mean, Nya-tan.

00:06:38.850 --> 00:06:39.870
Seriously?

00:06:41.290 --> 00:06:42.880
<b>TV Shopping</b>

00:06:43.190 --> 00:06:45.300
Have you been forgetting things lately?

00:06:46.550 --> 00:06:48.970
<b>New Product!</b>

00:06:46.550 --> 00:06:48.970
<b>Original Product</b>

00:06:46.550 --> 00:06:48.970
<b>Emotion Toy Balls</b>

00:06:46.550 --> 00:06:48.970
These Emotion Toy Balls, 
or E-To-Balls for short,

00:06:48.970 --> 00:06:51.430
will stimulate your memory!

00:06:48.970 --> 00:06:51.430
Squeeze Squeeze

00:06:52.150 --> 00:06:53.610
Munch, munch, munch.

00:06:53.610 --> 00:06:55.930
So, as you just saw,

00:06:54.390 --> 00:07:06.150
<b>Munch Munch</b>

00:06:55.930 --> 00:06:58.240
Nya-tan's always teasing Piyo-tan...

00:06:58.240 --> 00:07:01.330
That is, freeing her from her hatred.

00:07:01.330 --> 00:07:02.050
Wow.

00:07:02.050 --> 00:07:04.120
So Uri-tan, are your ribs okay now?

00:07:04.120 --> 00:07:05.450
I'm just fine.

00:07:05.450 --> 00:07:08.180
But fragments of Piyo-tan's memories of

00:07:08.180 --> 00:07:12.160
being freed from hatred still 
remain in her soul...

00:07:12.480 --> 00:07:15.930
So even if she forgets why,

00:07:15.930 --> 00:07:18.950
she always retains the feeling that she 
just hates Nya-tan for some reason.

00:07:18.660 --> 00:07:21.040
Hiss~

00:07:18.950 --> 00:07:21.040
That personality must be 
pretty rough on her.

00:07:21.280 --> 00:07:22.880
It's not her personality.

00:07:22.880 --> 00:07:26.830
The roosters are one of the clans that 
tend to hold on to negative emotions.

00:07:27.130 --> 00:07:30.300
One of them? So there are 
other clans like that?

00:07:30.610 --> 00:07:33.200
You ask quite shrewd questions.

00:07:33.200 --> 00:07:35.350
Well, you'll learn all that in time.

00:07:36.360 --> 00:07:38.930
Hey! Stop it!

00:07:37.440 --> 00:07:40.080
I'll turn you into yakitori!

00:07:40.440 --> 00:07:43.260
Are the cats a clan that tend to be stupid?

00:07:43.260 --> 00:07:44.610
Not at all.

00:07:44.610 --> 00:07:47.940
Eto-musume of the cat clan are 
gentle and quite strong.

00:07:47.940 --> 00:07:51.700
<b>Teriyaki</b>

00:07:48.360 --> 00:07:51.700
They're benevolent peace lovers 
who dislike conflict.

00:07:52.020 --> 00:07:54.450
Their combat ability far 
exceeds that of the others.

00:07:54.450 --> 00:07:57.200
They're known as the strongest 
of the Eto-musume.

00:08:00.900 --> 00:08:03.590
Next time you tease me, 
I won't let you off so easily.

00:08:03.590 --> 00:08:04.630
Remember that!

00:08:05.380 --> 00:08:09.380
You don't even remember anything yourself. 
You're in no position to say that.

00:08:09.830 --> 00:08:12.380
She doesn't look like the 
strongest of the Eto-musume.

00:08:12.730 --> 00:08:15.870
Nya-tan can't help that. She's got amnesia.

00:08:15.870 --> 00:08:17.680
What? Is that true?

00:08:18.040 --> 00:08:19.160
Oh.

00:08:19.160 --> 00:08:20.550
She does?

00:08:20.550 --> 00:08:22.560
I never knew.

00:08:23.160 --> 00:08:24.760
Amnesia?

00:08:25.060 --> 00:08:27.900
Is that why she's trying to find herself 
and decide on a character type?

00:08:27.900 --> 00:08:31.650
She's forgotten a lot of important things.

00:08:31.650 --> 00:08:33.050
Poor girl...

00:08:33.630 --> 00:08:37.260
I should be pitied far more, though!

00:08:37.260 --> 00:08:38.390
Yes, of course.

00:08:38.390 --> 00:08:42.290
Oh, no! I never knew she'd been 
through something so tragic!

00:08:42.290 --> 00:08:43.660
If you want to cry,

00:08:43.660 --> 00:08:47.060
you should cry on my chest!

00:08:48.920 --> 00:08:52.810
Mo-tan sees Nya-tan simply as a female.

00:08:52.810 --> 00:08:54.190
I see...

00:08:58.510 --> 00:09:02.390
Oh! Please don't stimulate 
my breasts so much!

00:09:02.390 --> 00:09:04.840
My milk... My milk...

00:09:05.440 --> 00:09:07.110
As a fellow Eto-shin,

00:09:07.110 --> 00:09:09.750
I feel a strong need to apologize for her.

00:09:09.750 --> 00:09:11.300
She never changes.

00:09:13.660 --> 00:09:14.620
Here.

00:09:15.760 --> 00:09:18.820
This is all more than 
human logic can process.

00:09:18.820 --> 00:09:20.180
You must be tired.

00:09:20.180 --> 00:09:22.120
Rest your mind a bit.

00:09:22.120 --> 00:09:23.870
Where'd that come from?

00:09:23.870 --> 00:09:26.180
Th-Thank you...

00:09:30.590 --> 00:09:31.940
Isn't that...

00:09:31.940 --> 00:09:35.150
The source of the Eto-musume's 
life force, Sol/Lull.

00:09:35.150 --> 00:09:36.680
The ultimate Sol/Lull, at that.

00:09:36.680 --> 00:09:39.510
My, what fine Sol/Lull that is!

00:09:42.810 --> 00:09:43.920
You see?

00:09:43.920 --> 00:09:47.230
There aren't many humans who 
possess Sol/Lull like this.

00:09:47.550 --> 00:09:48.770
No, there aren't.

00:09:49.020 --> 00:09:50.610
That makes him...

00:09:51.280 --> 00:09:52.940
Today's special offer!

00:09:52.940 --> 00:09:55.400
We'll start this Ultimate

00:09:53.070 --> 00:09:58.070
<b>Ultimate Sol/Lull Maker</b>

00:09:55.400 --> 00:09:57.450
Sol/Lull Maker at 100 yen!

00:09:57.450 --> 00:09:58.070
Why?!

00:09:58.070 --> 00:10:00.160
I'll buy him for 110 yen!

00:09:58.070 --> 00:10:06.620
<b>Ultimate Sol/Lull Maker</b>

00:10:00.160 --> 00:10:01.440
150 yen!

00:10:01.440 --> 00:10:02.830
Then I'll bid 151 yen!

00:10:02.830 --> 00:10:04.380
Okay, I'll bid 152 yen!

00:10:02.830 --> 00:10:05.320
They're starting a bidding war over me!

00:10:04.380 --> 00:10:06.620
Then I'll bid 153 yen!

00:10:05.320 --> 00:10:06.620
And that's cheap!

00:10:06.620 --> 00:10:08.620
155 yen!

00:10:09.380 --> 00:10:11.230
I'm bidding 155 yen!

00:10:11.230 --> 00:10:12.600
No, I am!

00:10:13.880 --> 00:10:15.790
Then I'll bid 100 million.

00:10:15.790 --> 00:10:17.340
Now it's incredibly high!

00:10:17.610 --> 00:10:19.290
Then I'll go with 200 million.

00:10:19.290 --> 00:10:20.510
250 million!

00:10:20.980 --> 00:10:22.970
700 million if a secondary prize is included.

00:10:22.970 --> 00:10:24.970
Hang on! What kind of bidding war is this?!

00:10:25.360 --> 00:10:26.550
Stop!

00:10:27.580 --> 00:10:29.390
Takeru is not an object!

00:10:29.390 --> 00:10:30.860
You're all cruel!

00:10:32.950 --> 00:10:34.070
Nya-tan...

00:10:38.540 --> 00:10:39.770
Got it.

00:10:39.770 --> 00:10:40.660
She tricked me!

00:10:41.080 --> 00:10:43.470
What exactly is Sol/Lull, anyway?

00:10:43.470 --> 00:10:45.020
Didn't I just tell you?

00:10:45.020 --> 00:10:47.700
It's the source of an 
Eto-musume's life force.

00:10:47.700 --> 00:10:50.010
But why does it come out of me?

00:10:50.010 --> 00:10:53.100
Sol/Lull is the embodiment 
of proper human emotions.

00:10:51.170 --> 00:10:55.420
<b>Proper Emotions</b>

00:10:53.100 --> 00:10:55.960
It's a type of energy only humans possess.

00:10:55.960 --> 00:10:58.220
"Proper" emotions?

00:10:58.460 --> 00:11:01.720
You know, every time you've felt grateful,

00:11:00.180 --> 00:11:02.430
<b>Thank You</b>

00:11:01.720 --> 00:11:03.680
Sol/Lull has appeared.

00:11:05.760 --> 00:11:09.770
<b>Cat</b>

00:11:06.470 --> 00:11:10.390
And when Sol/Lull collects in an 
Eto-musume's soul, their Etotama,

00:11:10.390 --> 00:11:14.110
they transform from Adult Mode, the form 
that allows them to exist in the human world,

00:11:14.490 --> 00:11:16.680
to the form that allows them to

00:11:16.680 --> 00:11:19.540
fight in the Eto world, Pretty Mode.

00:11:20.770 --> 00:11:22.130
I see.

00:11:23.700 --> 00:11:26.790
Takeru, give me more!

00:11:26.790 --> 00:11:29.330
Give me more of yours!

00:11:29.330 --> 00:11:31.160
Let go of me.

00:11:31.670 --> 00:11:34.290
If you're going to cling to a body,

00:11:34.290 --> 00:11:35.850
cling to mine!

00:11:35.850 --> 00:11:36.460
No!

00:11:37.450 --> 00:11:40.620
Oh, listen to you! 
You're such a meaniehead!

00:11:40.620 --> 00:11:42.260
No! Takeru!

00:11:42.260 --> 00:11:44.220
That was a pretty 
old-fashioned expression...

00:11:44.660 --> 00:11:48.090
But why does Nya-tan want 
that stuff so badly?

00:11:48.090 --> 00:11:48.810
Because...

00:11:49.290 --> 00:11:51.640
She's not an Eto-shin.

00:11:52.660 --> 00:11:56.230
The twelve of us Eto-shin 
are divine messengers,

00:11:56.230 --> 00:12:00.070
so we obtain Sol/Lull through humans' 
devotion without even doing anything.

00:12:00.480 --> 00:12:03.950
But the girls who haven't been 
selected to be in the twelve

00:12:03.950 --> 00:12:07.420
have to gather Sol/Lull on their 
own in order to transform.

00:12:33.580 --> 00:12:36.940
What low-quality Eto-musume 
we have this time around.

00:12:39.020 --> 00:12:44.030
<b>[Eto-musume Transformations] Eto-musume can take three forms. 
Adult Mode is how they appear under normal circumstances, 
Pretty Mode allows them to use Sol/Lull more easily, 
and Natural Mode is their animal form.</b>

00:12:44.030 --> 00:12:49.030
<b>[ETM12] A divine ritual. It was once called the 
Eto-shin Selection Festival, but is now called "ETM12" 
as a shortened form of "Eto-musume 12."</b>

00:13:02.590 --> 00:13:04.800
Why are you making curry?

00:13:05.480 --> 00:13:08.830
To thank you for breakfast. 
It's almost lunch time.

00:13:08.830 --> 00:13:10.060
But first...

00:13:13.450 --> 00:13:16.440
Takeru, give me Sol/Lull!

00:13:16.930 --> 00:13:19.570
I want yours, Takeru!

00:13:19.570 --> 00:13:20.320
Grr.

00:13:20.320 --> 00:13:21.650
Oh!

00:13:21.900 --> 00:13:24.400
It's jealousy!

00:13:25.090 --> 00:13:28.090
If only my love could produce Sol/Lull...

00:13:28.090 --> 00:13:30.410
But all I can produce is milk!

00:13:30.410 --> 00:13:32.620
You've never produced milk!

00:13:32.620 --> 00:13:34.290
And if you did, I wouldn't want it!

00:13:34.290 --> 00:13:35.450
Oh...

00:13:35.450 --> 00:13:38.190
What could I give you to

00:13:38.190 --> 00:13:40.040
make you accept my love?

00:13:40.040 --> 00:13:42.500
There's nothing I'd take from you!

00:13:43.920 --> 00:13:45.170
Yes, there is!

00:13:45.220 --> 00:13:48.180
<b>Ox</b>

00:13:45.830 --> 00:13:48.180
Give me your Sol/Lull Seal, Mo-tan!

00:13:48.670 --> 00:13:49.900
Of course!

00:13:49.900 --> 00:13:52.270
If you can collect twelve Sol/Lull Seals,

00:13:52.270 --> 00:13:54.280
you'll become an Eto-shin.

00:13:54.280 --> 00:13:56.940
That's right! So hand it over!

00:13:56.940 --> 00:13:58.310
Okay!

00:13:58.310 --> 00:14:01.110
This tough, bossy Nya-tan is good, too!

00:14:01.110 --> 00:14:01.940
But...

00:14:02.250 --> 00:14:04.920
I can't just give it to you for free.

00:14:04.920 --> 00:14:07.600
The rules say there's no problem 
with you giving it away for free.

00:14:07.600 --> 00:14:08.700
No, no.

00:14:09.040 --> 00:14:11.430
I want to grapple it out

00:14:11.430 --> 00:14:13.700
with you in a real battle!

00:14:14.020 --> 00:14:15.040
All right!

00:14:15.660 --> 00:14:18.390
Then we'll fight for your Sol/Lull Seal!

00:14:18.390 --> 00:14:20.080
Okay, Nya-tan!

00:14:21.480 --> 00:14:22.750
Then...

00:14:23.490 --> 00:14:25.260
Let the battle begin!

00:14:23.880 --> 00:14:25.260
<b>Approved</b>

00:14:24.310 --> 00:14:25.260
Get ready.

00:14:25.490 --> 00:14:28.860
Etotama! Sol/Lull Charge!

00:14:26.920 --> 00:14:27.420
<b>Ox</b>

00:14:36.730 --> 00:14:38.140
Go!

00:14:58.720 --> 00:15:01.870
Ox Eto-shin, Mo-tan!

00:15:04.310 --> 00:15:05.670
You heard her!

00:15:05.670 --> 00:15:08.210
Give me your Sol/Lull too, Takeru!

00:15:08.210 --> 00:15:10.010
I can't do it just like that...

00:15:10.010 --> 00:15:12.480
Just close your eyes, think of me,

00:15:12.480 --> 00:15:14.820
let the pleasant feeling 
take over, and it'll come out!

00:15:14.820 --> 00:15:16.180
No, it won't.

00:15:16.480 --> 00:15:17.770
It will! It will! It will!

00:15:17.770 --> 00:15:19.790
Come on! Let's do this thing!

00:15:20.220 --> 00:15:22.840
You know, if you asked me whether I think the

00:15:22.840 --> 00:15:24.940
way you're acting will inspire 
any "proper" emotions...

00:15:24.940 --> 00:15:26.070
It won't.

00:15:27.980 --> 00:15:30.070
It's okay, Nya-tan.

00:15:30.070 --> 00:15:31.170
Take this.

00:15:31.450 --> 00:15:32.630
What's that?

00:15:32.630 --> 00:15:34.090
This morning,

00:15:34.090 --> 00:15:37.330
when Takeru-san found out 
you were making breakfast,

00:15:35.740 --> 00:15:37.330
<b>Leave breakfast to me! Meow!</b>

00:15:37.330 --> 00:15:40.860
his shy, happy gratitude 
produced this Sol/Lull.

00:15:44.670 --> 00:15:46.050
All right!

00:15:46.360 --> 00:15:49.470
With this and the Sol/Lull I 
got before, I've got enough!

00:15:49.890 --> 00:15:51.720
Thanks, Takeru!

00:15:53.820 --> 00:15:56.260
Etotama! Sol/Lull Charge!

00:15:55.260 --> 00:15:55.760
S-Sure...

00:16:12.450 --> 00:16:14.680
Cat Eto-musume, Nya-tan!

00:16:21.030 --> 00:16:24.560
It looks like the time has come 
when I must give an explanation.

00:16:24.560 --> 00:16:25.910
What now?

00:16:25.910 --> 00:16:29.050
The Eto-shin Selection Festival, 
held once every sixty years,

00:16:29.050 --> 00:16:31.600
where Eto-musume can attain the rank 
of Eto-shin with their own fists...

00:16:30.210 --> 00:16:32.130
<b>Eto-shin Selection Festival</b>

00:16:31.600 --> 00:16:34.440
That's the ETM12!

00:16:34.440 --> 00:16:37.340
ETM12 is the name of a festival, then?

00:16:37.340 --> 00:16:39.070
For Nya-tan to become an Eto-shin,

00:16:39.070 --> 00:16:42.210
she must defeat all twelve Eto-shin in 
battle while the ETM12 is in progress

00:16:42.210 --> 00:16:45.720
and obtain all of their Sol/Lull Seals.

00:16:49.000 --> 00:16:50.290
That line was too long.

00:16:50.290 --> 00:16:51.280
You were waiting for her?

00:16:51.640 --> 00:16:54.080
Okay, let's decide the battle rules!

00:16:54.080 --> 00:16:55.450
We'll play a game of tag.

00:16:55.680 --> 00:16:59.660
If you can protect a certain item 
for three minutes, you win,

00:16:59.660 --> 00:17:01.740
and I'll give you my Sol/Lull Seal.

00:17:01.740 --> 00:17:03.370
Yay! Huh?

00:17:03.370 --> 00:17:04.540
A certain item?

00:17:04.940 --> 00:17:06.860
That would be...

00:17:06.860 --> 00:17:08.540
Your socks!

00:17:08.540 --> 00:17:10.680
Wh-Wh-What kind of gross rule is that?!

00:17:10.680 --> 00:17:11.460
No, no, no!

00:17:11.460 --> 00:17:14.530
I've been wearing these for three days!

00:17:14.530 --> 00:17:16.340
Used socks are

00:17:16.340 --> 00:17:19.010
the best!

00:17:19.250 --> 00:17:22.510
I was kidding! I was kidding!  
I change them every day!

00:17:25.220 --> 00:17:26.880
It hurt you that much?

00:17:27.440 --> 00:17:29.240
But that's no problem.

00:17:29.540 --> 00:17:32.170
As long as they're socks you've worn,

00:17:32.170 --> 00:17:34.110
that's good enough!

00:17:34.110 --> 00:17:36.860
I'm gonna throw all I've got 
into taking your socks!

00:17:38.870 --> 00:17:41.200
Let's start!

00:17:48.540 --> 00:17:50.210
If that's how it is, I'll show you!

00:17:52.680 --> 00:17:54.380
Where'd you go?

00:17:54.380 --> 00:17:56.380
All I have to do is run away and I win!

00:18:01.150 --> 00:18:02.890
You can do it, Nya-tan!

00:18:02.890 --> 00:18:04.850
Go for twelve wins and no losses!

00:18:05.070 --> 00:18:08.820
No losses? Didn't she lose 
to Dora-tan the other day?

00:18:08.820 --> 00:18:10.410
Oh, that battle...

00:18:10.410 --> 00:18:11.730
That was just a skit.

00:18:12.300 --> 00:18:15.320
What happens if Nya-tan loses 
in an official battle?

00:18:15.540 --> 00:18:18.190
In that case, she'd lose her Sol/Lull Seal

00:18:18.190 --> 00:18:20.630
and lose the ability to 
transform into Pretty Mode.

00:18:20.630 --> 00:18:24.590
And she'd lose the right 
to participate in ETM12.

00:18:24.590 --> 00:18:28.460
By the way, we Eto-shin can accept 
challenges from Eto-musume

00:18:25.870 --> 00:18:30.380
<b>Eto-shin</b>

00:18:28.460 --> 00:18:30.380
and fight as many times as we want.

00:18:31.570 --> 00:18:34.590
How will she fight Mo-tan?

00:18:34.590 --> 00:18:35.590
Is she strong?

00:18:36.020 --> 00:18:37.970
Her personality's a little weird,

00:18:37.970 --> 00:18:40.760
but she's one of the five 
strongest Eto-shin.

00:18:41.660 --> 00:18:45.150
Nya-tan! Where are you?

00:18:44.230 --> 00:18:45.640
Sneak, sneak, sneak...

00:18:46.600 --> 00:18:50.100
I'm clever, so I'll just 
stay here and hide.

00:18:51.360 --> 00:18:53.360
I found you!

00:18:57.030 --> 00:18:59.110
H-How did you find me?!

00:18:59.110 --> 00:19:00.700
No matter where you are,

00:19:00.700 --> 00:19:03.530
I can find you by your smell!

00:19:03.530 --> 00:19:06.730
Now give me those nice, 
warm socks, please!

00:19:06.730 --> 00:19:07.830
I refuse!

00:19:10.590 --> 00:19:13.090
Oh! Wait for me!

00:19:13.090 --> 00:19:15.340
Nya-tan!

00:19:15.560 --> 00:19:16.800
<i>This is bad...</i>

00:19:18.360 --> 00:19:20.430
<i>I'm gonna lose!</i>

00:19:28.040 --> 00:19:31.070
Nya-tan, you should give up.

00:19:31.070 --> 00:19:32.070
Mo-tan...

00:19:32.650 --> 00:19:33.980
I have no choice.

00:19:34.430 --> 00:19:36.370
I'll accept your love.

00:19:36.820 --> 00:19:39.150
There's the dere!

00:19:39.150 --> 00:19:42.660
Here we go!

00:19:44.480 --> 00:19:46.160
I will join the Chinese zodiac!

00:19:46.500 --> 00:19:47.370
Special attack:

00:19:47.370 --> 00:19:48.040
<b>Cat</b>

00:19:48.480 --> 00:19:51.530
Cat Gun!

00:19:50.330 --> 00:19:52.880
<b>Cat Gun</b>

00:20:04.480 --> 00:20:05.620
Wow...

00:20:05.620 --> 00:20:06.760
This is...

00:20:14.040 --> 00:20:17.910
I... love... Nya-tan...

00:20:21.780 --> 00:20:22.700
<b>Ox</b>

00:20:25.870 --> 00:20:28.430
Mo-tan's Sol/Lull Seal...

00:20:29.040 --> 00:20:30.640
is mine!

00:20:32.040 --> 00:20:34.020
The battle is over.

00:20:39.470 --> 00:20:40.550
I won!

00:20:40.830 --> 00:20:42.550
I really won!

00:20:42.990 --> 00:20:44.300
I never expected...

00:20:44.560 --> 00:20:46.180
Who knew she was that strong?

00:20:46.410 --> 00:20:47.680
Amazing...

00:20:47.930 --> 00:20:49.890
That's right!

00:20:49.890 --> 00:20:52.940
I'm a cat who can do it when she tries!

00:20:52.940 --> 00:20:53.980
Be more surprised!

00:20:54.320 --> 00:20:56.230
Shower me with praise!

00:20:56.230 --> 00:20:58.400
Mo-tan's not waking up.

00:20:58.890 --> 00:21:02.290
Looks like she's used up all her Sol/Lull.

00:21:02.290 --> 00:21:03.550
Isn't that a really big deal?

00:21:03.550 --> 00:21:04.950
Not as big a deal as me!

00:21:05.170 --> 00:21:08.440
She beat Mo-tan with just 
that amount of Sol/Lull?

00:21:08.440 --> 00:21:09.800
Yes, <i>I</i> did!

00:21:10.470 --> 00:21:11.700
Wh-What?

00:21:11.700 --> 00:21:13.640
I don't know why,

00:21:13.640 --> 00:21:16.540
but you seem to be a battery 
loaded with Sol/Lull.

00:21:17.050 --> 00:21:18.920
A battery... I see.

00:21:18.920 --> 00:21:20.420
Battery! Battery!

00:21:20.690 --> 00:21:21.640
A battery.

00:21:21.640 --> 00:21:23.420
Don't make a face as if that makes sense!

00:21:23.420 --> 00:21:24.930
Forget about that!

00:21:25.420 --> 00:21:26.990
Praise me!

00:21:26.990 --> 00:21:29.020
Okay, I get it! Stop thrashing around!

00:21:29.020 --> 00:21:30.780
By the way, it stinks like curry!

00:21:30.780 --> 00:21:32.060
The curry is not to blame.

00:21:32.060 --> 00:21:34.610
That's right. The curry did nothing wrong.

00:21:34.610 --> 00:21:36.480
Lively around here, isn't it?

00:21:36.840 --> 00:21:39.190
I'd say it's just noisy.

00:21:40.840 --> 00:21:42.400
By the way, is it true that Chu-tan

00:21:42.400 --> 00:21:45.370
defeated all of the other

00:21:45.370 --> 00:21:48.170
107 Eto-musume?

00:21:48.170 --> 00:21:50.990
Yes, it seems so.

00:21:56.550 --> 00:21:57.510
I...

00:21:58.500 --> 00:22:01.000
I cannot allow the cat clan

00:22:01.430 --> 00:22:02.450
to exist.

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:47.610
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:35.850 --> 00:23:38.920
Here's the fortune for those 
born in the year of the boar!

00:23:38.920 --> 00:23:40.500
Your lucky item this week is mud.

00:23:40.500 --> 00:23:43.740
If you roll in mud, bugs won't 
be able to cling to your body!

00:23:43.740 --> 00:23:44.870
What're you talking about?

00:23:44.870 --> 00:23:46.090
That's boar wisdom.

00:23:46.090 --> 00:23:47.610
Again, what are you talking about?!

00:23:47.610 --> 00:23:49.700
Next time: Reckless Heart

00:23:47.610 --> 00:23:50.030
<b>Reckless Heart</b>

00:23:50.030 --> 00:23:54.070
<b>Being around Nya-tan makes me tired.</b>

00:23:50.030 --> 00:23:54.070
<b>Dragon</b>

00:23:50.030 --> 00:23:54.070
<b>I'll do my best.</b>

00:23:50.030 --> 00:23:54.070
<b>Watch again next week! 
Illustration: Uchida Maaya</b>
